      "description": "Header 01ffffff: plays the next 128 bytes as 256 ADPCM nibbles.",
      "behaviour": "Bits 0 to 5 plus one are the rate; each nibble lasts rate x 4 chip clocks, high nibble of each byte first. Then the next byte is a header.",
